        "number": 12,
        "internalPageId": 12,
        "title": "Sentences Questions 0. John used to be smaller a couple of years ago. Did John use to be smaller a couple of years ago? 1. Pete used to burp a lot in school. It was gross. 2. Sarah used to wear long hair but not any more. 3. He used to be part of the soccer team back in college. 4. I used to talk loud but I stopped that. 5. They used to talk during movies when they were younger.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "Sentences Questions 0. John used to be smaller a couple of years ago. Did John use to be smaller a couple of years ago? 1. Pete used to burp a lot in school. It was gross. 2. Sarah used to wear long hair but not any more. 3. He used to be part of the soccer team back in college. 4. I used to talk loud but I stopped that. 5. They used to talk during movies when they were younger.",
          "A. Change the sentences to questions.Follow the example. Finally, give your teacher three more examples with their corresponding questions.",
          "B. Listen to two people talking. What are they saying? Tell your teacher. Take some notes if necessary."
        ],
